    "chunk_text": "God na deadra ac lybbyndra. \u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrde \u00fea wundrudon hig hys lare. \u00dea \u00fea Phariseiscean gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6t he het \u00fea Saduceiscan stylle beon; \u00fea eodon hig tog\u00e6dere. & an \u00fee w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6ys lareow axode hyne & fandode hys \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende. La lareow, hw\u00e6t ys \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ste bebod on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6? \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend, lufa Drihten \u00feinne God on ealre \u00feinre heortan & on ealre \u00feinre sawle & on \u00deis ys \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ste & \u00fe\u00e6t fyrmyste bebod. O\u00feyr ys \u00feysum gelic, lufa \u00feinne nehstan swa swa \u00fee sylfne. On \u00feysum twam bebodum by\u00fe gefylled eall seo \u00e6. \u00dea \u00fea Pharisciscean gegaderude w\u00e6run \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lynd. Hw\u00e6t \u00feinc\u00f0 eow be Criste, hw\u00e6s sunu ys he; Hig cw\u00e6dun, Dauides. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend, hwi clypa\u00f0 Dauid hyne on gaste Drihtyn & cwy\u00f0. Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to minum Drihtne, site on mine swy\u00feran healfe o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t ic gesette \u00feine fynd \u00fee to Gyf Dauid hyne on gaste Dryhten clypa\u00f0, hu ys he hys sunu? \u00d0a ne mihton hig him nan word andswarian, ne nan ne dorste of \u00f0am d\u00e6ge hyne nan \u00feing mare \u00dea spr\u00e6c se H\u00e6lynd to \u00feam folce & to hys leorningcnyhton. & cw\u00e6\u00f0, boceras & Pharisei s\u00e6tun of",
